     double up_late_min_fraction{0.0};
+    // DCS Control (0075), from the review of 0070-0074:
+    //  - up_late_gate_clean: 0072's rule above holds only for the misses a
+    //    failed 1X leaves behind - from a 1X left on misses or on the work
+    //    until 2 has gone this long without a missed slot (or 1X is entered
+    //    again, or the scene changes). After that, and in a session that
